step Goldshire
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip On the road from Stormwind to Westfall, Goldshire is the first stop: Remy "Two Times" stands outside the inn, Marshal Dughan beside him. Remy's A Fishy Peril goes straight to Dughan, who then gives Further Concerns; his Report to Gryan Stoutmantle goes with you to Westfall.
  accept 40 only Dwarf,Gnome -- Remy "Two Times"
  turnin 40 only Dwarf,Gnome -- Marshal Dughan
  accept 35 only Dwarf,Gnome
  accept 109 only Human,NightElf,Skyborne -- Marshal Dughan: for Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill

step The Tower of Azora
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip East along the road past Crystal Lake: Hamish Bergwort and Blixie Fitzwink stand at the foot of the tower.
  accept 91725 only Dwarf,Gnome -- Blixie Fitzwink

step The bridge
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Guard Thomas guards the bridge on the road east; Ormin Pelford stands just across it. His tools and Thomas's Prowlers and bears are south of the bridge, on the way back.
  turnin 35 only Dwarf,Gnome -- Guard Thomas
  accept 37 only Dwarf,Gnome
  accept 52 only Dwarf,Gnome
  accept 91733 only Dwarf,Gnome -- Ormin Pelford

