step Downstream
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip The Waterlogged Saw, Axe and Toolbox lie in the river south of the bridge. Princess, a big boar, roots in the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch west of the river with her Porcine Entourage: pull the piglets away first. Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears on the way. Careful: Croaky is a level 11 elite on the murloc shore. Only go for his head with a group; otherwise leave him: it's optional.
  kill 822 quest 52 only Dwarf,Gnome -- Young Forest Bear
