  tip Young Goretusks root in the fields along the road south from Saldean's to Sentinel Hill: take their snouts on the way.
  collect 731 quest 38.3 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Goretusk Snout

step Sentinel Hill
  zone Westfall
  tip Gryan Stoutmantle and Captain Danuvin stand at the top of the stone tower. Quartermaster Lewis is in the tower, Scout Galiaan on the south side of the hill, next to the inn and Thor the gryphon master.
